OL,3,GNEWSACouncil runs patrols targeting
OL,4,Abusiness waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrols and investigations into
OL,7,Fbusinesses leaving bagged commercial
OL,8,Fwaste outside their premises for long
OL,9,Fperiods is "already making a
OL,10,Fdifference", a council has said.
OL,12,FIpswich Borough Council said it had
OL,13,Fissued 67 fixed penalty notices during
OL,14,Fthe summer to businesses found
OL,15,Fbreaching waste regulations, with a
OL,16,Ffurther 22 cases being processed.
OL,18,FA spokesperson said waste could be torn
OL,19,Fopen and scattered across surrounding
OL,20,Fstreets and public spaces.
